Package: qt6-declarative
Version: @DEB_QTDECLARATIVE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.qt.io/
Depends: qt6-base
Description: Qt 6 QML and QtQuick for the Xios desktop
 The QML engine and the QtQuick scene graph, plus the standard QML modules
 (QtQuick, QtQuick.Controls, QtQuick.Layouts and friends). QML runs on the
 QV4 bytecode interpreter in this build; there is no JIT, which suits the
 fakesigned jailbreak environment.
 .
 The heart of the KDE Plasma Mobile flavor of the Xios desktop: the Plasma
 shell and most KDE frameworks are written in QML.
